    "title": "Which ex-high school standouts from Ocean County area will play on Saturday, Dec. 6? - Ocean County Leader",
    "text": "These ex-Ocean County area high school standouts will participate in competitions on Saturday, Dec. 6.\nAnthony DeMarco\nEastern Eagles\nFreshman\n5′11″ 191\nToms River East High School\nHometown: Toms River\nNext Game: vs. Susquehanna Riverhawks, Saturday, Dec. 6, 12 p.m.\nCharles Davison\nKutztown Golden Bears\nFreshman\n6′1″ 265\nPoint Pleasant Borough High School\nHometown: Point Pleasant\nNext Game: vs. Frostburg State Bobcats, Saturday, Dec. 6, 12 p.m.\nJosh Moore\nJohns Hopkins Blue Jays\nSophomore\n5′10″ 180\nToms River North High School\nHometown: Toms River\nNext Game: vs. Salisbury Sea Gulls, Saturday, Dec. 6, 12 p.m.\nPatrick Fulginiti\nKutztown Golden Bears\nSenior\n6′3″ 285\nSouthern Regional High School\nHometown: Manahawkin\nNext Game: vs. Frostburg State Bobcats, Saturday, Dec. 6, 12 p.m.",
